line Check" style="box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: 1.8 / 1; background-image: url(&quot;https://developer.mozilla.org/static/client/high-dark.a3f9e002a70b98e8.svg&quot;); background-position: 50% center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: contain; display: block; width: 2.5rem;"></span><div class="status-title" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0px; padding: 0.375rem 0px;">Baseline</div><div class="pill" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(15, 122, 52); border-radius: 0.25rem; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.025rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase;">Widely available</div><div class="asterisk" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: auto;">*</div><div class="browsers" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;"><span class="engine" title="Supported in Chrome 및 Edge" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box oklch(1 0 0 / 0.06); border-radius: 2rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.625rem;"><span class="browser chrome supported" role="img" aria-label="Chrome check" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex;"></span><span class="browser edge supported" role="img" aria-label="Edge check" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex;"></span></span><span class="engine" title="Supported in Firefox" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box oklch(1 0 0 / 0.06); border-radius: 2rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.625rem;"><span class="browser firefox supported" role="img" aria-label="Firefox check" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex;"></span></span><span class="engine" title="Supported in Safari" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box oklch(1 0 0 / 0.06); border-radius: 2rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.625rem;"><span class="browser safari supported" role="img" aria-label="Safari check" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex;"></span></span></div><span class="icon icon-chevron" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline-block; height: 20px; mask-position: center center; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-size: contain; width: 20px; mask-image: url(&quot;/static/client/chevron-down.7c923b7054da305b.svg&quot;); position: absolute; right: 16px;"></span></summary><div class="extra" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0.5rem 1rem 1rem;"><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px;">This feature is well established and works across many devices and browser versions. It’s been available across browsers since 2020년 3월.</p><p class="asterisk-note" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px; background-color: oklch(0.364 0.1 155); border-radius: 0.25rem; font-size: 12.8px; padding: 0.25rem 0.25rem 0.25rem 0.5rem;">* Some parts of this feature may have varying levels of support.</p><ul style="box-sizing: border-box; gap: 1rem 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 12.8px; justify-content: space-between; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><li style="box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; margin: 0px;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%EB%B8%8C%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%EC%A0%80_%ED%98%B8%ED%99%98%EC%84%B1" data-glean-id="baseline_link_bcd_table" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(164, 206, 254); font-weight: 500;">See full compatibility</a></li><li style="box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; margin: 0px;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Glossary/Baseline/Compatibility" data-glean-id="baseline_link_learn_more" target="_blank" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(164, 206, 254); font-weight: 500;">Learn more</a></li></ul></div></details><section class="content-section" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75;"><p style="box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">Clipboard API</strong>는 클립보드 명령(잘라내기, 복사, 붙여넣기)에 응답하거나 시스템 클립보드에 비동기적으로 접근하고 쓸 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.</p><div class="notecard note" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(7, 36, 70); border-inline-start: 2px solid rgb(164, 206, 254); border-radius: 0.25em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-block: 1em; padding-block: 1px; padding-inline: 3em 1em; position: relative; --accent-color: light-dark(#044c9f,#a4cefe);"><p style="box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">참고 :</strong> 이 API는 <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(164, 206, 254); text-decoration: underline;">웹 워커</a>에서 사용할 수 <strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">없습니다</strong>. (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WorkerNavigator" class="only-in-en-us" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(164, 206, 254); text-decoration: underline;"><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(45, 48, 52); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">WorkerNavigator</code></a>에 노출되지 않음)</p></div><p style="box-sizing: border-box;">Clipboard API는 <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Document/execCommand" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(164, 206, 254); text-decoration: underline;"><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(45, 48, 52); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">document.execCommand()</code></a>를 사용한 클립보드 접근을 대체하기 위해 디자인되었습니다.</p></section></div><aside class="layout__right-sidebar reference-layout__toc" style="box-sizing: border-box; grid-area: right-sidebar; max-height: 763px; outline-offset: -2px; overflow-y: auto; position: sticky; top: 98px; margin-right: -16px; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; place-content: start space-between; align-items: start; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(24, 25, 27); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><nav class="reference-toc" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><h2 style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; padding: 0.75em 0px;">In this article</h2><ul style="box-sizing: border-box; display: grid; list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C_%EC%A0%91%EA%B7%BC" data-glean-id="toc_click: #클립보드_접근" aria-current="true" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: rgb(10, 93, 189) -2px 0px 0px 0px; display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgb(7, 36, 70);">클립보드 접근</a></li><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%8A%A4" data-glean-id="toc_click: #인터페이스" aria-current="true" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: rgb(10, 93, 189) -2px 0px 0px 0px; display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgb(7, 36, 70);">인터페이스</a></li><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%EB%AA%85%EC%84%B8" data-glean-id="toc_click: #명세" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: rgb(81, 86, 93) -2px 0px 0px 0px; display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none;">명세</a></li><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%EB%B8%8C%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%EC%A0%80_%ED%98%B8%ED%99%98%EC%84%B1" data-glean-id="toc_click: #브라우저_호환성" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: rgb(81, 86, 93) -2px 0px 0px 0px; display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none;">브라우저 호환성</a></li><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%EA%B0%99%EC%9D%B4_%EB%B3%B4%EA%B8%B0" data-glean-id="toc_click: #같이_보기" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: rgb(81, 86, 93) -2px 0px 0px 0px; display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none;">같이 보기</a></li></ul></nav><mdn-placement-sidebar style="box-sizing: border-box;"></mdn-placement-sidebar></aside><div class="layout__body reference-layout__body" style="box-sizing: border-box; grid-area: body; padding-bottom: 3rem; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(24, 25, 27); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="클립보드_접근" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75;"><h2 id="클립보드_접근" class="heading" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25; margin: 1rem 0px 0px; font-size: 32px;"><a class="heading-anchor" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C_%EC%A0%91%EA%B7%BC" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit !important; text-decoration: none;">클립보드 접근</a></h2><p style="box-sizing: border-box;">시스템 클립보드에 접근할 땐 <code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(45, 48, 52); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">Clipboard</code> 객체의 인스턴스를 생성하지 않고, 전역 <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Navigator/clipboard" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(164, 206, 254); text-decoration: underline;"><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(45, 48, 52); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">Navigator.clipboard</code></a>를 사용합니다.</p><mdn-code-example class="brush: js notranslate" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 1rem 0px;"><div class="code-example" style="box-sizing: border-box; --border: 1px solid light-dark(#c3c7cb,#51565d); border: 1px solid rgb(81, 86, 93); border-radius: 0.25rem; overflow: hidden;"><div class="example-header" style="box-sizing: border-box; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(81, 86, 93); display: flex; line-height: 1; min-height: 3.1rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0.5rem 1rem; gap: 0.5rem;"><span class="language-name" style="box-sizing: border-box; text-transform: uppercase; margin-right: auto;">js</span><mdn-copy-button variant="secondary" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><mdn-button variant="secondary" style="display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle;"><button class="button" part="button" aria-labelledby="label-iyl7yb2sg6f" data-variant="secondary" style="align-items: center; background-color: initial; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 0.25rem; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); column-gap: 0.3125em; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 0.875em; font-weight: 450; justify-content: